# Kopieer naar .env (staat in .gitignore) en vul in.
# Supabase-dashboard › Project Settings › API (of "API Keys").
# ALLEEN de project-URL en de publishable (of legacy "anon") key. NOOIT de secret/service_role key.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://jouw-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Zonder Supabase ontwikkelen of testen: `npm run dev:local` (alles in de browser, wachtwoord "dev-password").
